msgstr "書き出し先..."

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"Choose a save above to export it as an .mcs file; Import puts an .mcs save "
"from the file on this card."
msgstr "上のセーブを選ぶと .mcs ファイルに書き出せます。「取り込む」はファイルの .mcs セーブをこのカードに入れます。"

#: port/src/ui/sections.cpp
msgid ""
"The game is using this card right now: go back to the game and try again in "
